Package: kelpbio
Title: Bayesian Kelp Biomass Estimation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seb", "Dalgarno", , "seb@poissonconsulting.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3658-4517")),
    person("Tula Foundation", role = c("fnd", "cph")))
Description: Fit Bayesian hierarchical Stan models via 'rstan' to estimate kelp
    biomass and carbon from in-situ observations, including allometric weight,
    plant size distribution, density, and wet-to-dry and carbon
    tissue conversions.
